cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, cite the exact commit and analysis ID and also
  cite the original GSE89223 study (doi:10.18632/oncotarget.16518).
type: software
title: "RNASeqAnalysisWithSalmon: GSE89223 prostate cancer RNA-seq reanalysis"
authors:
  - given-names: Hossein
    family-names: Shahsavari
repository-code: "https://github.com/KingriderHossein/RNASeqAnalysisWithSalmon"
abstract: >-
  Scientific reanalysis of GSE89223 using Salmon, tximport and DESeq2,
  with separate publication-comparison and paired-sensitivity cohorts,
  documented validation gates and comparison to the original publication.
  Biological quality review and full reproducibility closure remain open.
keywords:
  - RNA-seq
  - Salmon
  - tximport
  - DESeq2
  - prostate cancer
  - GSE89223
